{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10641020","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10641020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1064102001:2":{"text":"眩しい朝の光が散乱した部屋に差し込み、血だまりに横たわるリロの姿を照らし出していた。","source_cn":"刺目的晨光映入屋内，照出了满地狼藉，以及躺在血泊中的列罗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5EFF9D67C9382E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1064102002:1":{"text":"エミーニはその傍らに跪き、震えが止まらないまま、薬瓶を握りしめて彼に飲ませようとしていた。","source_cn":"埃米妮跪在他身旁的阴影里，止不住地战栗着，拿着一瓶药似...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x969A45D2EE806AD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1064102003:1":{"text":"しかし、それはもう何の意味もなさない。リロの心臓の鼓動はすでに止まっていたのだ……","source_cn":"可惜，那没有任何作用。列罗的胸口早已没了起伏的迹象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x646C8EB29D0B85E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064102004:1":{"text":"あ……あなた、しっかりして。私が……必ず助けてあげる……","source_cn":"列罗……列罗，坚持住。我……我一定能救你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC1D94F7AEE430E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064102005:1":{"text":"お父さん……目を覚ましてよ！ほら、シスターさんたちが来てくれたよ。神さまが守ってくれる！","source_cn":"爸爸……爸爸醒一醒！我把修女们找来了，神……神一定会庇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECA573E4DB4AE492","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064102006:1":{"text":"お父さん……目を開けてよ……うぅぅ……","source_cn":"爸爸……你醒醒啊……呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0E3B43888A61FF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064102007:1":{"text":"一歩遅かったようね……","source_cn":"看来我们来晚了一步……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62CC708C3D522810","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064102008:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064102009:1":{"text":"申し訳ございません、エミーニさん。間に合うことができず……","source_cn":"抱歉，埃米妮，我们没能及时赶到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2DD522B4DF2BD4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064102010:1":{"text":"リロさんは……もう逝ってしまいました。どうか、その手を放してあげてください。彼がデューラ様のもとへ帰れるように……","source_cn":"列罗……他已经离去。请放开他的手，让他回到艾雅身边，不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x786F9F298E4D662D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064102011:1":{"text":"違う、そんなはずない……リロが死ぬなんてあり得ない！","source_cn":"不，不，怎么可能……列罗他不会死的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5246E0EF28F1954C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064102012:1":{"text":"こ……この薬があれば助かるはずなんです。なのに、どうして効かないのよ！？","source_cn":"这瓶药……这瓶药明明能救他，为什么不起作用？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD57464529BDC5200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064102013:1":{"text":"嘘よ……絶対に信じない。一生を共にするって約束したじゃない……！どうして……","source_cn":"我不相信……他怎么可能会死？我们明明约定过要共度一生…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE42D402C04D99954","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064102014:1":{"text":"はい……あなたの苦しみはよく分かります、エミーニさん。","source_cn":"是的，是的……我明白你的痛苦，埃米妮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87B956184C7B28E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064102015:1":{"text":"泣いてください。思いっきり泣けば、少しずつ楽になっていきますから……","source_cn":"哭出来吧。哭出来，一切都会慢慢好起来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEB2821A412BD04C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064102016:1":{"text":"エミーニさん、しっかりしてください。","source_cn":"你也需要治疗，埃米妮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B8C3D27ED4DBAF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064102017:1":{"text":"つらいでしょうが……どうか気を強く持ってください。あなたには、まだジラコ君がいるんですから。","source_cn":"……也请振作一点吧。无论如何，你还有吉拉科。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87BFD9967EEC3B9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064102018:1":{"text":"うぅぅ、お母さん……","source_cn":"呜呜呜，妈妈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB15EB8698EC258C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064102019:1":{"text":"ジラコ……ごめんね、可哀相に……","source_cn":"吉拉科……我可怜的孩子……呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F1BA4A0247EA01B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064102020:1":{"text":"デューラ様、この哀れな母子にご加護を……","source_cn":"艾雅在上，多么可怜的一对母子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03FF93BB8AB931E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064102021:1":{"text":"ルイーザさん、これからどうすればいいのでしょう？リロさんを殺した犯人は、わたしたちで探すのですか？","source_cn":"路易莎修女，列罗的后事该怎么办？还有杀害他的真凶，该怎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AC5E47EE66F4099","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064102022:1":{"text":"彼女たちに付き添って、まずリロさんの遺体を教会まで運んでくれる？修道者たちが葬儀の準備をしてくれるはずだから。私はここに残って、犯人の痕跡を探してみるわ。","source_cn":"你先陪埃米妮和吉拉科将列罗的遗体运到教堂吧，修士们会为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA410D52F5E5C4508","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064102023:1":{"text":"もし特定できそうもなければ、早急に村人たちに周知し、警戒を強めてもらう必要がある。","source_cn":"如果暂时无法确定凶手的身份，这件事也必须尽早通知各位村...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB51FF7AAEA887CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064102024:1":{"text":"分かった。","source_cn":"好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2839CC05014FE4F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:31::0":{"text":"ブラックゴールドの薬剤","source_cn":"黑金药水","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21DB926DD5667D11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064102025:0":{"text":"あと、エミーニさんが飲ませていた薬瓶も持ち帰っていいですか？表面の妙な刻印が気になって……","source_cn":"埃米妮喂给列罗的这瓶药要不要一起带回教堂？瓶身上的印记...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x715B3530DB1F306F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064102026:0":{"text":"そうね、でもひとまず置いておいて。いちおう証拠品だから。","source_cn":"暂时留在这里吧，不要破坏周围的痕迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9384341337479C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064102027:1":{"text":"エミーニさんは……リロさんの出血に気が動転し、とにかく助けたい一心で飲ませたのでしょう……","source_cn":"我想，埃米妮只是一时无法接受列罗的离去，才会绞尽脑汁地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB15480751F7A533E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:37:1064102028:0":{"text":"エイダは母子に寄り添いながら、リロの遺体を教会へ運んだ。","source_cn":"艾达陪伴着母子俩，将列罗的遗体运回了教堂","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2F9B16DFF70A76C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:38:1064102029:0":{"text":"ほどなくして、ルイーザも慌ただしく戻ってきた。","source_cn":"不久之后，路易莎也匆匆返回","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA54477FDABA1CD12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064102030:1":{"text":"ルイーザさん、犯人の手がかりは見つかりましたか？","source_cn":"路易莎修女，您有找到凶手留下的线索吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC65002CE398882F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064102031:1":{"text":"いいえ、何も……事