你回忆今早的事...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE93FEB53473298C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064102037:1":{"text":"リロさんを襲った犯人の姿を、覚えてはいませんか？","source_cn":"你有没有看清，袭击列罗的人长什么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AAC4887943776C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064102038:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064102039:1":{"text":"どうか気を強く持ってください。犯人を捕まえてこそ、リロさんの無念を晴らせるのですよ。","source_cn":"请振作一点。只有抓到凶手，我们才能替列罗报仇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB582896D175286F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064102040:1":{"text":"はい、このようなことを犯した者は必ず罰せられなければなりません。どうか手を貸してください。","source_cn":"是的，造成这一切的歹徒应当受到惩罚。现在只有你能帮助我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F25DCB0993BFFD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064102041:1":{"text":"そ、そうですね……","source_cn":"我、我知道了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4532390DF144CD27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064102042:1":{"text":"犯人は背が高くて……髪は長めだったと思います……","source_cn":"袭击列罗的那个人，个子很高，头发也有些长……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD97C845B3CB7D0A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064102043:1":{"text":"それから……目が青かった気がします。まだ暗かったので、ぼんやりですが……","source_cn":"好像……好像是是蓝眼睛。那时候天色太暗，我只是模模糊糊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44D51760DC33F8B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064102044:1":{"text":"犯人は何か言ってませんでした？そこから逃亡先を推測できるかもしれません。","source_cn":"凶手可有说过什么？我们或许能推测出他之后的去向。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A8A919C1330ED5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064102045:1":{"text":"か、彼は……","source_cn":"他、他说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E32495DBC9AF33A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064102046:1":{"text":"いえ、何も言っていません……とにかく、すべて私のせいなんです！悪いのは私です！","source_cn":"……不，他什么也没说……总之，总之都是我的错！是我的错！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAACBA716E5DEF505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064102047:1":{"text":"私がエンサ村に来なければ、私が幸せなんて望まなければ……リロは死なずに済んだんです！うぅっ……！","source_cn":"要不是我来了恩莎村，要不是我奢望幸福，要不是我赖在这儿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A9131F070580FC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064102048:1":{"text":"どうか自分を責めないでください。リロさんの死はただの不幸な事故で、あなたのせいなどではありません。","source_cn":"埃米妮，请不要自责，列罗的离去只是一个意外，和你没有关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD58EC31C360B0DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1064102049:1":{"text":"いいえ、あなたは何も知らない……これは間違いなく私のせいなんです！","source_cn":"不，你不明白……这就是我的错！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53E46F8326116E20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064102050:1":{"text":"お、お母さん……お母さん……","source_cn":"妈妈，妈妈……呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF62270AB39B32566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064102051:1":{"text":"はぁ……","source_cn":"唉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC104553A784DD22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064102052:1":{"text":"エイダ、ここは私とカンタギスに任せて、ジラコ君を外に連れていってあげて。","source_cn":"艾达修女，你先带吉拉科出去透透气。这里交给我和康塔格修士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62D7A8BCA8B4B60E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:71:1064102053:1":{"text":"子どもに聞かせるべきではない話もあるから……","source_cn":"有些话，不适合让孩子们听到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C1052DFA3BCA5B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064102054:1":{"text":"はい、分かりました。","source_cn":"是，路易莎修女。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D793980CD5ABF5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:74:1064102055:0":{"text":"エイダはジラコの手を引き、教会の外の静かな場所へ連れていった。","source_cn":"艾达牵着吉拉科来到教堂外的安静之处","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19A190831F4D3F77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064102056:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1064102057:1":{"text":"エイダさん……どうして、お母さんはあんなことを言ったの？","source_cn":"艾达姐姐，为什么……为什么我妈妈会说那样的话？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x613E2EEA27CF7231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064102058:1":{"text":"それにお父さんは……本当にもう帰ってこないの？","source_cn":"还有爸爸……他真的再也不会回来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F847C9A8B4AEDB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064102059:1":{"text":"お父さんは女神様のところへ行って、そこで安らかに眠るのよ。","source_cn":"……他已经回归了女神的天国，他会在那里获得安息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7416EAC539097F81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064102060:1":{"text":"お母さんは……たぶん大きなショックを受けて、まだ現実を受け入れられないだけだと思う。","source_cn":"至于你母亲，她只是受到的打击太大，一时无法接受现实。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99621CF4515528A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:82:1064102061:1":{"text":"ジラコ君がそばで支えてあげれば、きっとすぐ元気になるわ。分かるわよね？","source_cn":"如果你能坚强地陪伴她度过这段时间，她一定很快就能好起来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9421208ABC78EBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1064102062:1":{"text":"うん……分かってる。お父さんもいつもぼくに、「お母さんを守るんだぞ」って言ってたから……","source_cn":"我……我知道。爸爸以前经常和我说，要保护妈妈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B017DB464EDCA23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064102063:1":{"text":"でも、犯人はまだ捕まってないんだよね……？もしもまた、お母さんを傷つけに来たらどうするの？","source_cn":"可是，坏人还没有抓到……要是他还想伤害我妈妈，我该怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37028ADFB4015103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1064102064:1":{"text":"悪い人は……必ず罰を受けるんだよね？","source_cn":"坏人……为什么没有受到惩罚呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27ED26287DCB33A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064102065:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:87:1064102066:1":{"text":"ジラコ君、あなたにひとつお話をしてあげる。","source_cn":"吉拉科，我给你讲个故事吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B9D35069EA7F31B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:88:1064102067:1":{"text":"……どんなお話？","source_cn":"……什么故事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1A0CF7A6F1727FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:89:1064102068:1":{"text":"デューラ様に仕えるアタリア様の話よ。「ジャスティスブレード」って聞いたことない？","source_cn":"你听说过侍奉艾雅的“天罚之刃”——阿塔利娅吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x931833E040F3E38E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:90:1064102069:1":{"text":"ジャスティスブレード？","source_cn":"天罚之刃？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3EED1E4F3029AB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:91:1064102070:1":{"text":"聖典によれば、かつて女神の聖槍だったアタリア様は、女神の恩寵を受けて人の姿へと化した最初のセレスチアルとされている。","source_cn":"在圣典的记载中，阿塔利娅是艾雅女神的骑枪，也是第一位蒙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x930FCC3CF633A723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:92:1064102071:1":{"text":"伝説の中では、彼女は悪を憎む正義の裁定者で、邪悪なものを粛清する使命を背負っているの。","source_cn":"在传说中，她是嫉恶如仇的正义裁决者，肩负着肃清邪恶的使命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC69DE6DC24883E5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:93:1064102072:1":{"text":"だからもし誰かが悪人に傷つけられたら、アタリア様に祈りを捧げればいい。そうすれば彼女が天から舞い降り、必ずその者を裁いてくれる。いかなる悪人も決して逃れられないわ。","source_cn":"如果有人被恶人伤害，只要虔诚地向阿塔利娅大人祈祷，她就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC713A741FB94250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:94:1064102073:1":{"text":"……ほんとに？祈りを捧げるだけで、悪い人は罰を受けるの？","source_cn":"……真的吗？只要虔诚地祈祷，坏人就能得到惩罚？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DFB542C036F3C3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:95:1064102074:1":{"text":"もちろん。アタリア様は正義の裁定者だって言ったでしょ。","source_cn":"当然，阿塔利娅大人可是正义的裁决者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8EA786770AB26DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:96:1064102075:1":{"text":"うん、分かったよ！","source_cn":"嗯，我明白了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F5F7C8A64388FDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:97:1064102076:1":{"text":"強いアタリアさま、どうか悪い人を罰して、お父さんの仇を取ってください！","source_cn":"厉害的阿塔利娅大人，求您一定惩罚坏人，替我爸爸报仇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BD1939610C49715","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:98:1064102077:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:99:1064102078:1":{"text":"エイダさん、こんなのでアタリアさまに届くのかな？","source_cn":"艾达姐姐，这样做是不是阿塔利娅大人就能听见了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE560784DCB78B66A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":